  "specialTraitsDescription": "<p><em><strong>Nimble Escape.</strong></em> The goblin can take the <a class=\"tooltip-hover action-tooltip\" href=\"/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#DisengageAction\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" data-tooltip-href=\"/actions/5-tooltip\" data-tooltip-json-href=\"/actions/5/tooltip-json\">Disengage</a> or <a class=\"tooltip-hover action-tooltip\" href=\"/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#HideAction\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" data-tooltip-href=\"/actions/8-tooltip\" data-tooltip-json-href=\"/actions/8/tooltip-json\">Hide</a> action as a bonus action on each of its turns.</p>",
  "actionsDescription": "<p><em><strong>Scimitar.</strong> Melee Weapon Attack:</em> <span data-dicenotation=\"1d20+4\" data-rolltype=\"to hit\" data-rollaction=\"Scimitar\">+4</span> to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 5 <span data-dicenotation=\"1d6+2\" data-rolltype=\"damage\" data-rollaction=\"Scimitar\" data-rolldamagetype=\"slashing\">(1d6 + 2)</span> slashing damage.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Shortbow.</strong> Ranged Weapon Attack:</em> <span data-dicenotation=\"1d20+4\" data-rolltype=\"to hit\" data-rollaction=\"Shortbow\">+4</span> to hit, range 80/320 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 5 <span data-dicenotation=\"1d6+2\" data-rolltype=\"damage\" data-rollaction=\"Shortbow\" data-rolldamagetype=\"piercing\">(1d6 + 2)</span> piercing damage.</p>",
